WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
I want to tell you

2
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Well you said

3
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,450
A helicopter can't transport many people in one trip

4
00:00:04,450 --> 00:00:06,700
A wave of loss last night

5
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:08,700
We lost a third

6
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:09,700
You saw it with your own eyes too

7
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:12,540
Well that's it

8
00:00:12,540 --> 00:00:14,540
You might as well contact the outside world

9
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,300
Let the moon map come to meet us

10
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:19,300
I don't have that much face

11
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:21,300
They are all busy with other things

12
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:23,300
If you send me here, I am the lowest and most useless.

13
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:25,300
The biggest rescue that can be given is a helicopter

14
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:27,300
If it doesn't make sense

15
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:28,300
You will officially join us

16
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:29,300
I will support you from now on

17
00:00:29,300 --> 00:00:30,300
Not going back

18
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:33,510
This is the second team

19
00:00:33,510 --> 00:00:34,510
The next step is just

20
00:00:34,830 --> 00:00:35,830
Relying on a little identity

21
00:00:35,830 --> 00:00:36,830
It is important to maintain authority

22
00:00:36,830 --> 00:00:38,830
A vase with no strength at all

23
00:00:38,830 --> 00:00:43,140
The good days are coming to an end soon

24
00:00:43,140 --> 00:00:44,140
Yue Tu will try to break through today

25
00:00:44,140 --> 00:00:46,140
Everyone evacuates to the west
